    text Get information about rental, home buying, and home repair assistance programs. Learn how to find emergency housing and avoid foreclosure and eviction.
    row
      link "Emergency housing assistance Find emergency housing and learn how to get emergency rent assistance." /emergency-housing-assistance
      link "Eviction and foreclosure Learn how you may be able to prevent or deal with eviction or foreclosure." /eviction-and-foreclosure
      link "Rental assistance Learn about government programs for affordable housing and find out if you qualify." /rental-housing-programs
      link "Home repair and energy efficiency assistance Learn about government programs that may help with repairing or making improvements to your home." /repairing-home
      link "Home buying assistance Learn about government programs that make it easier to purchase a home." /buying-home-programs
      link "Housing assistance for Native Americans The government offers funding to tribes and Native American individuals and families to build, buy, and renovate housing." /native-american-housing-help
